<title>AUSTRIA: Italy says will do utmost to make EMU start.</title>
<headline>Italy says will do utmost to make EMU start.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi said on Wednesday Italy would do its utmost to make the start of a single European currency.</p>
<p>&quot;Italy will do everything it can to be among the first countries that will take in the first phase of EMU,&quot; Ciampi said after a meeting with his Austrian counterpart Viktor Klima.</p>
</text>
